flowchart TB
  Observation[New observation] --> Conflict{Conflicting strong identity?}
  Conflict -->|Yes| Separate["Separate record; retain conflict"]
  Conflict -->|No| Signals["Compare normalized endpoint, source ID, registration ID, infrastructure composite"]
  Signals --> Match{Supported strong match?}
  Match -->|No| New[Create new canonical ID]
  Match -->|Yes| Merge[Merge into existing canonical ID]
  New --> Explain["Store decision, evidence, and timestamps"]
  Merge --> Explain
  Separate --> Explain
  Example["Security Agent card + Kubernetes endpoint + runtime endpoint"] --> Signals
